00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:40.820
Simplifiez la logique

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:41.380
autant que possible.

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:42.360
Moins d'étapes,

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:43.380
des instructions plus claires,

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:44.480
une ambiguïté minimale.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.560
L'ennemi de l'automatisation

00:17:46.560 --> 00:17:47.380
n'est pas l'aléatoire,

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:48.680
